        "id": 1182824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-18T08:43:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The initial idea of Tony and I was thinking of a table as well, but we think it can be reduced to comparing the voltage deltas. \n\nI add dps_config which contains an member for is_more_efficient override. Can you check if that fulfills your need?",
      "parentUuid": "69168ebd_4ae8adb9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 59,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 62,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "bc81dbdfd9ec9c412f3057d639c321c02df9f3a5",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
