      "writtenOn": "2021-06-18T08:55:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "... and we\u0027ve seen quite a few different PDO voltage/current combinations (e.g. voltages: 5, 7.5, 9, 10, 12, 15, 20), and the table might need efforts to fine-tune for different battery configurations.",
      "parentUuid": "068d0b97_7b42af24",
